OL,3,GNEWSANeurodiverse woman 'found her
OL,4,Apeople' in agriculture
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Sophie Dillon, a career in
OL,7,Fagriculture has brought "freedom" from
OL,8,Fnine-to-five office life, where she
OL,9,Fstruggled as someone who is autistic
OL,10,Fand has ADHD.
OL,12,FThe 29-year-old from Telford is among
OL,13,Fthose who contributed to research by
OL,14,FKaren Fisher, who hopes her PhD at
OL,15,FHarper Adams University will provide a
OL,16,Fbetter understanding of why
OL,17,Fneurodiverse people are drawn to the
OL,18,Ffield.
OL,20,FSeed genetics expert Dillon said: "I
OL,21,Ffound my people in agriculture."
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
