OL,3,GNEWSANeurodiverse woman 'found her
OL,4,Apeople' in agriculture
OL,5,
OL,6,FFisher, whose day job is as an
OL,7,Fagronomist and soil adviser, said the
OL,8,FPhD "combines two things I'm very
OL,9,Fpassionate about", having herself being
OL,10,Fdiagnosed with ADHD at the age of 39.
